                  are the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+classes"} homotopy classes
                  of morphisms of
                  = succeed "," do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi 𝒞
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalence+classes"} equivalence classes
                  of morphism under
                  = succeed "." do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/left+homotopy"} left homotopy
          %p
            This is, up to
            = succeed "," do
